            'description' => 'The Polans, the strongholds, the founding legend and the baptism of 966: how Slavic tribes became a state, and how much of it is evidence.',
        ],
        'hero' => [
            'kicker' => 'History · The Middle Ages · Topic 01',
            'title' => 'How Poland',
            'title_accent' => 'came to be',
