                    'query' => 'Manufaktura Lodz', 'stay' => '1 h 30', 'arrive' => 'start',
                    'note' => 'The cotton mill of Izrael Poznanski, a quarter of red brick the size of a small town. It stopped working in the 1990s and reopened in 2006 as shops, a cinema and two museums. Start here, because it shows you the scale before you look at any of the detail.',
