                    'query' => 'Palac Poznanskiego Lodz', 'stay' => '1 h', 'arrive' => '2 min on foot',
                    'note' => 'The palace Izrael Poznanski built at the gate of his own mill, so that he could see it from the windows. It is the city museum now, and the rooms are exactly as loud as the money that paid for them.',
