            'note' => 'Two and a half hours north-west of Warsaw, on the river Brda just above where it meets the Vistula. The canal that made the city runs west from the middle of it.',
            'caption' => 'Schematic locator drawn on modern borders. The pin is placed from the real coordinates of the city.',
            'alt' => 'Map of Poland with Bydgoszcz marked in the north centre',
