                ['tag' => 'Old and unresolved', 'title' => 'Bydgoszcz and Torun hate each other', 'note' => 'They are twenty-five minutes apart, they share one region, and since 1999 they have shared its government, with the assembly in one city and the governor in the other. Locals turn it into a standing joke. It is a rivalry about offices and money, not about anything older.'],
