                ['year' => '1873', 'note' => 'Doctor Tytus Chalubinski begins sending patients to the village for the mountain air and brings his friends with him. The Tatra Society is founded in the same year to open the mountains to walkers.'],
                ['year' => '1891', 'note' => 'Stanislaw Witkiewicz designs the villa Koliba, the first house in what he calls Zakopane style: highland carpentry reworked into an architecture he intends as Polish and national.'],
