                ['tag' => 'Half true', 'title' => 'Zakopane is a tourist trap', 'note' => 'The main street is, and in the high season it is unpleasant. Walk twenty minutes off it, take one of the valleys instead of the cable car, or come in October, and the same town is quiet, cheap and surrounded by one of the best ranges in this part of Europe. The trap is only where the coaches stop.'],
