                    'price' => 'Soup and a main, about 25 to 35 zloty',
                    'note' => 'A canteen left over from the communist years that the state still subsidises, so a meal here costs a fraction of what it costs anywhere else. You queue, say what you want at the hatch, take a tray and sit down at a table with strangers. It is cooked that morning, and nine times out of ten it is genuinely good.',
                    'credit' => 'Photo: Kamil Czaiński, CC BY-SA 4.0',
